  "security_scope": "Original WIP finite counter action, not ready for real funds. Accepts exactly one StateTruth = (opaque ephemeral tree . canonical u64 count), returns the same ephemeral tree and checked count+1 with no conditions. Incrementing u64::MAX rejects. The explicit Cons output is an action result, not a condition list or complete standalone coin puzzle. Canonical action-layer, finalizer and singleton host composition is separate from these original Rust/Chialisp/Rue actions. Standalone VM output does not establish signature validity, complete-spend acceptance, a general registry/slot demo, live Testnet11 use or compiler preservation.",
